WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.484
Welcome to payroll officer training.

2
00:00:02.484 --> 00:00:09.248
This is where salaries become payments — correctly, on time, and fully compliant with Sierra Leone's tax law.

3
00:00:09.248 --> 00:00:17.626
We'll run a payroll preview, understand the gross-to-net calculation, export payslips and bank files, and look at statutory compliance.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.611
This is the payroll page. Choose the month and year, then always preview before you run.

5
00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:38.170
The preview computes every employee's gross pay, applies the N R A progressive P A Y E bands, deducts the five percent NASSIT employee contribution, applies any loan repayments — and shows you the exact net pay, with nothing committed yet.

6
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.756
When the preview looks right, the run button commits it.

7
00:00:49.756 --> 00:01:07.034
For government tenants, SaloneHCM first verifies the budget check for the period, respects the payroll cut-off lock, and routes the run into the Ministry of Finance approval chain — where the required number of distinct signatures must be collected before the run is approved.

8
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.301
Every completed run appears in the history below.

9
00:01:11.301 --> 00:01:24.066
From there you download individual payslip P D Fs, send bulk payslip S M S messages, and generate bank disbursement files in Rokel, S L C B, U B A, or Ecobank format — ready for upload to your bank portal.

10
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:33.142
The compliance page tracks your statutory obligations: monthly P A Y E returns to the N R A and NASSIT contribution schedules.

11
00:01:33.142 --> 00:01:39.343
SaloneHCM generates the exports in the exact expected format — pick the period, generate, and file.

12
00:01:39.343 --> 00:01:41.786
Deadlines are tracked so nothing slips.

13
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:50.457
The golden rules: preview before you run, never bypass a blocked budget check, and file returns before the deadline.

14
00:01:50.457 --> 00:01:55.178
Take the payroll officer quiz in the Training Center to certify your skills.
